==Description==
The '''Pike''' was the first enemy that appeared in the third and fourth night of the [[Solar Eclipse Event]]. It had a below average speed but a high amount of health for its debut.

==Appearance==
The '''Pike''' had green skin and wore a green and white checkered chestplate and pants, dark grey armor and a grey helmet. Its armor was broken, having holes in it. It walked with a slight hunchback. It had a pike strapped onto its back.

==Strategy==
*Cheap towers with high DPS, such as the [[Crook Boss]], {{Color|FFFF00|Golden}} [[Scout]] and [[Soldier]] are recommended to use against this enemy.
**For [[Crook Boss]] and [[Soldier]] you can use their {{Color|FFFF00|Golden}} skins for better performance.
*Splash damage towers, such as the [[Mortar]] and [[Ace Pilot]] can be effective as these enemies spawn in hordes.

